<title>UK: Black Sea port Novorossiisk reopens.</title>
<headline>Black Sea port Novorossiisk reopens.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Black Sea port of Novorossiisk reopened on Monday at 0300 GMT, shipping sources said.</p>
<p>Novorossiisk, Russia's main oil export port, closed on Friday at 1320 GMT as a result of strong winds and high swells, the source added.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 71 542 8978</p>
